- "[…] I’m not asking parents to force their kids to play with him, he’s not everyone’s cup of tea, and he always eventually finds kids who appreciate his eccentricities, but it breaks my heart that he’s had to learn resilience against bullying so young." [sr059-0074]
- "[…] "if you don't we will fight you and make you fall over, won't we guys" […]" [sr066-0072]
- "[…] I want my kid to be a good sharer. But I also want him to stand up for himself if a kid takes a toy he's playing with. […]" [sr071-0111]
