1 of 63 posts.

The parent of a two-year-old wants to try an hour of childcare for exercise or personal time after three hysterical Barre3 attempts at 16 months. They ask about gym childcare, a nearby parent during home babysitting, or a larger play environment. They also anticipate boredom and distress in a small room with limited toys.

