## Limits

The source is a keyword-free random sample of 20,000 posts from twelve parenting subreddits, 1 April–24 October 2026; 2,471 were on-niche, including this pattern’s 98 on-niche and 63 near posts. Counts are posts tagged by one reader, not people or market prevalence; apparent cross-posts retain separate IDs, and overlapping tags record explicit statements. Forms across digest readers would be merged by judgement; this pattern has one digest, all 161 posts read, and none excluded or unread.

